Return Home

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_ISLES_WAR_C23_desc]
The Las Pegasus Group is a peaceful, charitable business group. The group has just learned that a group of Equestrian sailors and students are stranded in the Evenchain Isles and other islands. The Las Pegasus Group will send ships to these places to bring these ponies back to Las Pegasus, so that they can set foot on Equestrian land again — definitely not to acquire their ships or island sovereignty.

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_ISLES_WAR_C23]
归乡

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_ISLES_WAR_C23_desc]
洛马基集团是一个爱好和平、充满慈善精神的商业集团。集团刚刚注意到，有一群小马利亚的水手与学生正滞留在偶链群岛等地。洛马基集团将会派遣船只前往这些地方，将这些小马接回洛马基，让他们能够重新踏上小马利亚的土地 —— 绝对不是为了获得它们的船只或是岛屿主权。

